# About 20 Knowledge

The heart of the vault: what you actually know, kept current. It holds three kinds of record — `note` (concepts, findings, claims, questions, lessons), `entity` (people, organizations, places, products), and `procedure` (how something is done) — each fact living in one place that everything else points at. Meaning here is carried by metadata and links rather than by filing: the type, the tags, the relations, and the per-type views rebuilt into `System/Generated/`. Decisions have their own home one level up, in `Decisions/`.
